  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Strengthening civil and polical rights            Civil Rights Defenders</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthening civil and political rights          Civil Rights Defenders - Civil Rights Defenders</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Syftet &#xE4;r att st&#xE4;rka medborgerliga och politiska r&#xE4;ttigheter i        Moldavien. Projektets aktiviteter bidrar till de &#xF6;vergripande         operativa m&#xE5;l: 1, att m&#xE4;nniskor har m&#xF6;jlighet att h&#xE4;vda sina          m&#xE4;nskliga r&#xE4;ttigheter. 2, att stater tar ansvar f&#xF6;r uppfyllandet av   de m&#xE4;nskliga r&#xE4;ttigheterna. 3, att st&#xE4;rka lokala                      m&#xE4;nniskor&#xE4;ttsf&#xF6;rsvarare.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The aim is to strengthen civil and political rights in Moldova. The   project activities contribute to the overall operative goals: 1, That people are empowered to claim their human rights. 2, That states take responsibility for the fulfillment of human rights. 3, That local     human rights defenders are empowered.</narrative>
  </description>
